{"u": "10767946926", "name": "HUSH: They can hear. (BETA)", "place": "133927229860262", "created": "2026-09-25", "updated": "2026-11-10T17:44:38.267Z", "genre": "Action", "subgenre": "Open World Action", "desc": "The town has been taken over by monsters, you emerge from the sewers after hiding for so long. Seems like they hunt with sound. Sneak in, loot, and get out before they hear you.\n\nLoot houses, shops, the hospital and the army camp. Hotwire cars, board up windows, there's exits and get inside before the doors shut. Get caught and you lose everything you carried. Sell your haul for guns, gear, gold guns and diamonds from the only shop left. Some people aren't as friendly.\n\nCONTROLS\nWASD move, Space jump, Shift run, C crouch (running: slide), Alt dive\nE use, Tab backpack, M map, F flashlight, N night vision\n1 2 3 weapons, Q holster, click fire, right click aim, R reload,  I inspect, V 1st person\nCars: F in/out, Shift drift, B belt, G wipers, H horn\nBuild, barricade, do whatever you must do to survive.\n\nIf your friends ask you what you're playing, tell them hushhhhhh (tell that to your friends)\n\nprivate servers dont save items, just for fun.\n\n", "desc_hash": "6dcb33146db8", "max_players": 30, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 11942379, "favorites": 126075, "creator": {"id": 659854159, "name": "theInstigators", "type": "Group", "verified": true}, "daily": {"2026-10-21": {"updated": "2026-10-21T16:59:26.518Z", "visits": 529402, "fav": 13938, "up": 2149, "down": 606}, "2026-10-22": {"updated": "2026-10-22T20:38:13.681Z", "visits": 1157159, "fav": 24432, "up": 3851, "down": 1079}, "2026-10-23": {"updated": "2026-10-23T16:33:25.402Z", "visits": 1724307, "fav": 32225, "up": 5097, "down": 1440}, "2026-10-24": {"updated": "2026-10-24T01:42:06.102Z", "visits": 2512495, "fav": 40670, "up": 6590, "down": 1813}, "2026-10-25": {"updated": "2026-10-24T01:42:06.102Z", "visits": 3368916, "fav": 48339, "up": 8346, "down": 2186}, "2026-